&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Altana is the network for trusted trade. Our AI-powered product network empowers governments and businesses to build a more resilient and secure global economy while keeping trade flowing.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;The Opportunity at Altana&lt;/p&gt;
